#: ProcessModel.cc:769
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of virtual memory space that the process is using, "
"included shared libraries, graphics memory, files on disk, and so on.  This "
"number is almost meaningless."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dit is de virtuelle Spieker, den de Perzess bruukt. Inslaten sünd deelt "
"Bibliotheken, Grafikspieker, Dateien op de Fastplaat usw.  Disse Tall "
"bedüüdt meist nix."

#: ProcessModel.cc:776
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process is using.  "
"It does not include any swapped out memory, but does include the code size "
"for shared libraries etc.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dit is de physikaalsche Spieker, den de Perzess bruukt. Inslaten is keen "
"utlagert Spieker, man de Kode ut deelt Bibliotheken usw.<br/><br/>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:778
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process is using by "
"itself.  It does not include any swapped out memory, nor the code size of "
"its shared libraries.  This is often the most useful figure to judge the "
"memory use of a program.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dit is de physikaalsche Spieker, den de Perzess för sik sülven bruukt. "
"Utlagert Spieker oder Kode binnen deelt Bibliotheken sünd nich inslaten. "
"Disse Tall seggt faken dat mehrste, wenn Een wat över den Spiekerbruuk vun "
"en Programm seggen will.<br/><br/>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:780
#, qt-format
msgid "Memory usage: %1 out of %2  (%3 %)<br/>"
msgstr "Spiekerbruuk: %1 vun %2 (%3 %)<br/>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:782
#, qt-format
msgid "Memory usage: %1<br/>"
msgstr "Spiekerbruuk: %1<br/>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:785
#, qt-format
msgid "RSS Memory usage: %1 out of %2  (%3 %)"
msgstr "RSS-Spiekerbruuk: %1 vun %2 (%3 %)"

#: ProcessModel.cc:787
#, qt-format
msgid "RSS Memory usage: %1"
msgstr "RSS-Spiekerbruuk: %1"

#: ProcessModel.cc:792
msgid "<qt>Your system does not seem to have this information for us to read, sorry."
msgstr "<qt>Dien Systeem lett dat Utlesen vun disse Weerten nich to, as't lett."

#: ProcessModel.cc:793
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process's shared "
"libraries are using.  This memory is shared among all processes that use "
"this library"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dit is de physikaalsche Spieker, den de deelten Bibliotheken vun dit "
"Programm bruukt. Disse Spieker warrt mit all Perzessen deelt, de een "
"Bibliotheek bruukt."

#: ProcessModel.cc:795
#, qt-format
msgid "<br/><br/>Shared library memory usage: %1 out of %2  (%3 %)"
msgstr "<br/><br/>Spiekerbruuk för deelt Bibliotheken: %1 vun %2 (%3 %)"

#: ProcessModel.cc:797
#, qt-format
msgid "<br/><br/>Shared library memory usage: %1"
msgstr "    >     Spiekerbruuk för deelt Bibliotheken: %1<br/><br/>"

